// performFileDropAction: what a file dropped on the main window does. Returns 1 when the drop was taken. Tools
// redefine this procedure to read their own files (mGear's guide templates and skin packs among them); the window
// calls the redefinition for every file dropped on it.

global proc int performFileDropAction(string $theFile)
{
    return performFileImportAction($theFile);
}
